---
// 頁尾：沿用 ARDGE 官網頁尾結構
const site = 'https://www.ardge.com';
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <img src={`${site}/img/common/logo/ardge-logo-white.webp`} alt="ARDGE" width="130" height="31" />
      <p>為軟體創新者打造的 AI 部署後盾。讓 AI 順利進入市場，不再為地端部署煩惱。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-cols">
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>產品</h4>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/products/arx-os`}>ARX OS</a>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/products/arx-100`}>ARX-100</a>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/products/varx-series`}>vARX 系列</a>
        <a href="#top">共同供應契約採購</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>解決方案</h4>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/solutions/ai-data-preprocessing`}>AI 資料前處理</a>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/solutions/private-intelligent-video-search`}>私有影片搜尋</a>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/solutions/knowledge-management-appliance`}>知識管理</a>
        <a href={`${site}/zh/solutions/private-ai-foundation-for-isv-partners`}>ISV 夥伴私有 AI</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>公司</h4>
        <a href={`${site}/zh#team`}>關於我們</a>
        <a href={`${site}/zh#contact`}>聯絡我們</a>
        <a href="mailto:usasales@ardge.com">usasales@ardge.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap footer-bottom">
    <span>Copyright © 2025-2026 ARDGE. 保留一切權利。</span>
    <span>105 台灣台北市松山區南京東路四段 130 號 12 樓之 1</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #c9cbce;
    padding-top: 64px;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 2fr;
    gap: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .footer-brand img {
    height: 30px;
    width: auto;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .footer-brand p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #9a9da2;
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .footer-col h4 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #9a9da2;
    padding: 6px 0;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-block: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #74777c;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .footer-cols {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
